# Nil ruled on 2026-08-22 that the repository tracks a RESULTS TABLE per experiment -
# the experiment reference, the two players, the winner, and the condition and start
# fields - and not the raw games. Those tables are in results/ and ARE tracked; the
# raw JSONL below stays on the 4090 desktop (54.15 MB, 1126 files, measured
# 2026-08-22). experiments.json records each archive's box, path, size, file count,
# parsed rows and content hash under `localRawArchive`.
